<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CONFRAM SAYS IN NEGOTIATIONS.</title>
<headline>CONFRAM SAYS IN NEGOTIATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Frame Textiles Ltd said on Monday it was engaged in talks which could have an impact on its share price and that of Frame Group Holdings Ltd. It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
